  "testProvenance": "Six worker and six provenance cases ran against0ec4200; all their runtime/test/verifier bytes are identical at03b6ac6. Full24 journey cases were rerun after the final03 Qt executable was frozen. Earlier mixed-binary runs are historical only, not acceptance evidence.",
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "SEC-001",
      "severity": "medium",
      "finding": "The view-counter adapter normalized noncanonical top-level epoch strings such as01 and+1 that accepted Desktop rejects.",
      "introducedCommit": "3de262d7f58d2bb2b86f979e975fa088a2eb41ec",
      "fixCommit": "0ec4200656374ccc2df23fd19dabf182ea1e4295",
      "disposition": "Closed: exact canonical lexical equality is required before translation; invalid epochs remain invalid. Independently rebuilt original committed worker and observed01 Quit accepted; accepted and fixed workers reject it withSTALE_VIEW. New native20 rejects noncanonical counters before/after handoff, as well as old/future generations."
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC-002",
      "severity": "medium",
      "finding": "Successful API metadata from another workflow/run on the same head could substitute for a failed VS3 run because archived run id/attempt were not bound.",
      "introducedCommit": "3de262d7f58d2bb2b86f979e975fa088a2eb41ec",
      "fixCommit": "0ec4200656374ccc2df23fd19dabf182ea1e4295",
      "disposition": "Closed: new verifier binds exact API run id/attempt, VS3 workflow path, repository, PR merge ref, source, head, Linux and completed success. Independently executed original hosted metadata condition showing substituted metadata accepted; fixed validator rejects it. All six provenance positives/negatives pass."
    },
    {
      "id": "INTEGRATION-001",
      "severity": "medium",
      "finding": "Qt/kernel reviewer identified that external valid snapshot CAS replacement needed a refresh reply after Desktop reopened.",
      "fixCommit": "0ec4200656374ccc2df23fd19dabf182ea1e4295",
      "disposition": "Independently inspected refresh/topologyCommitted:false correction and reran all six native cases, including actual external replacement with saved bytes preserved, updated pin state and zero guest calls."
    }
